      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/7ea924/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-11-06T12:16:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey everyone! Hanna gave me a bit of a poke in the forum's direction and mentioned it'd be a good idea to show up here, so here I am!</p><p>I'm Rowan Walker from Sydney. I demoed Galactic Strike Force for the three days at PAX Aus 2014, and LOVED every minute of it! Almost lost my voice though :D</p><p>I love Sentinels and GSF, and have only played a little of Tactics. I picked up GSF at PAX, and once my friend's returned it to me I'll be demoing it to all my friends and family!</p><p>Besides board games I'm a hardcore PC gamer, a pianist, a composer, a programmer, and a whole bunch of other fun things!</p><p>You can find out more at http://archmage.me where I've actually done an intro for myself :D</p><p>Hope to hear from all of you cool folks soon!</p><p>-Rowan</p>",
