      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/theta_sigma/{size}/1929_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-11-06T16:49:29.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yay Rowan!</p><p>To clarify his demoing, I asked him if he would be ok learning the demo scenario for GSF, he accepted and from then on in, every time I looked over at the table, there he was, excitedly &nbsp;teaching new people, and even some of the other volunteers how to play! He even asked to stay on that table for the following days!</p><p>Everyone was great at PAX, but since GSF is the game we know the least well, it was incredibly helpful for Rowan to stick around like he did.</p>",
